window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>We kissed once; when we were teenagers at a party.</p> <p>It was my first kiss and my first crush on a girl I could never have.</p> <p><b>If I had known then that she'd be the love of my life, I would have done things differently.</b></p> <p>My family moved away from the town I grew up in, but now I've moved back to start a life there.</p> <p>I never forgot about Hannah, but seeing her on her grandmother's front porch made my body heat.</p> <p>I can't help but notice the shock of electricity when our eyes meet and recognition fills her gaze.</p> <p>She is the only woman I've ever wanted.</p> <p>The only woman I've dreamed about.</p> <p><b>The only woman who was made to be mine.</b></p> <p><i>Beyond the Mountains </i>is Book 1 of the Awakening Love series, but can be listened to as a stand-alone. It is a spicy, 18+ romance with the following tropes: small-town romance, second chance romance, cinnamon roll hero, stubborn heroine, sexy farmer next door.</p>"; 
